12:13.690 --> 12:15.870
that sent science down the wrong path

12:15.870 --> 12:19.070
with quantum gravity in 1957.

12:19.070 --> 12:21.410
He was also backed by the highest levels

12:21.410 --> 12:23.510
of CIA and aerospace.

12:23.510 --> 12:26.210
There are even videos of Townsend Brown

12:26.210 --> 12:28.910
at the University of North Carolina Chapel Hill

12:28.910 --> 12:32.830
celebrating because his experiments presumably worked.

12:32.830 --> 12:35.090
Here he is with a bottle of champagne.

12:35.090 --> 12:38.230
