13:03.250 --> 13:07.050
The tests were very, very, very tricky.

13:07.050 --> 13:12.070
It was sensitive to so many things in vacuum.

13:12.070 --> 13:16.140
Finally it worked, so that was a positive result.

13:16.140 --> 13:18.200
And that's just the tip of the spear.

13:18.200 --> 13:21.340
We also have Carl Nell, who helped set up army

13:21.340 --> 13:24.740
the Futures Command, which led all tech modernization efforts

13:24.740 --> 13:27.520
for the army, implying that Townsend Brown

13:27.520 --> 13:29.680
made breakthroughs in the world of gravity.

13:29.680 --> 13:31.460
Jesse's done a number of podcasts

13:31.460 --> 13:33.180
