02:33:22.620 --> 02:33:27.160
Like, is there some sort of thing that you can relay

02:33:27.160 --> 02:33:28.620
about how the world works?

02:33:28.900 --> 02:33:31.340
No, I'm still trying to figure that.

02:33:31.860 --> 02:33:37.440
But in a nut and a shell, I know that we're not in control.

02:33:38.520 --> 02:33:43.080
That our thoughts are completely understood by something above us

02:33:43.080 --> 02:33:45.380
that knows everything about you.

02:33:46.060 --> 02:33:47.080
It knows your heart.

02:33:48.210 --> 02:33:49.310
It knows your intentions.

02:33:50.220 --> 02:33:53.400
