02:33:53.540 --> 02:33:55.120
If you're going the wrong way.

02:33:56.200 --> 02:33:58.080
That's the trickster part of it.

02:33:58.320 --> 02:33:59.420
But is that bad?

02:33:59.860 --> 02:34:04.120
You know, it's intended for you to marry this person, not that one.

02:34:04.460 --> 02:34:08.900
It might do what it takes to get you to meet this person.

02:34:10.800 --> 02:34:11.920
So fascinating.

02:34:12.140 --> 02:34:12.340
Yeah.

02:34:12.720 --> 02:34:15.820
And it's your job to be receptive and to kind of ride the wave

02:34:16.400 --> 02:34:17.820
or listen to the synchronicities?

02:34:18.720 --> 02:34:19.740
Yeah, that's what I do.

02:34:19.800 --> 02:34:21.260
I listen to the synchronicities.

02:34:21.260 --> 02:34:23.860
But my job is to share.

02:34:25.620 --> 02:34:29.420
The truth that everyone's been told is not real.

02:34:30.420 --> 02:34:34.720
And I caught so much problem from the community.

02:34:35.580 --> 02:34:40.940
In 2007, when this happened, half my family, two-thirds of my family,

02:34:41.080 --> 02:34:44.460
I quit speaking to my own cousins and family.

02:34:45.080 --> 02:34:47.500
And it was because they wouldn't believe me

02:34:47.500 --> 02:34:50.700
or I was being accused of messing with the devil, right?

02:34:51.890 --> 02:34:55.190
And so they actively got hard on me

02:34:55.190 --> 02:34:55.610
and tried to...

02:34:56.310 --> 02:34:58.190
remove my children from me.

02:34:58.370 --> 02:35:00.410
That was early on, right after it happened.

02:35:00.590 --> 02:35:02.950
And so I kind of took offense to everyone.

02:35:03.630 --> 02:35:06.230
And I made a vow then, I'm going to prove them all wrong.

02:35:06.330 --> 02:35:08.070
I'm going to prove the world wrong.

02:35:08.410 --> 02:35:09.410
That's what I said.

02:35:09.990 --> 02:35:11.610
Made that...

02:35:11.610 --> 02:35:14.730
And I worked on it pretty hard for 19 years

02:35:14.730 --> 02:35:18.950
of revealing something that nobody says is real.

02:35:19.990 --> 02:35:23.650
And what that is, I can't tell you with 100% certainty.

02:35:23.950 --> 02:35:26.070
But I can tell you in 19 years,

02:35:26.230 --> 02:35:27.830
I've experienced a lot of patterns

02:35:27.830 --> 02:35:31.250
and never no harm to me or anyone else

02:35:31.250 --> 02:35:32.770
that has experienced this.

02:35:32.810 --> 02:35:34.610
And I've shared it with thousands of people.

02:35:35.570 --> 02:35:38.500
Do you think the idea of disclosure

02:35:38.500 --> 02:35:40.840
is kind of a misnomer?

02:35:41.020 --> 02:35:43.040
