02:35:43.040 --> 02:35:45.540
some sort of metaphysical truth

02:35:45.540 --> 02:35:48.400
that they have this asymmetric understanding of.

02:35:48.560 --> 02:35:50.560
Yeah, I think we're in post-disclosure.

