02:36:04.390 --> 02:36:06.030
and it could be terrible, right?

02:36:06.130 --> 02:36:07.430
So it's national security.

02:36:09.380 --> 02:36:10.940
They're never going to give you that.

02:36:11.380 --> 02:36:14.320
So they're just going to give a talk all the time.

02:36:14.420 --> 02:36:16.080
We have, we've seen, we have.

02:36:16.360 --> 02:36:19.820
Disclosure is a one person at the time awakening.

02:36:20.860 --> 02:36:22.520
Suddenly you see it's real.

02:36:23.060 --> 02:36:23.900
You saw an orb.

02:36:23.980 --> 02:36:25.180
Oh my God, what was it?

02:36:25.200 --> 02:36:26.140
I don't know what it was,

02:36:26.220 --> 02:36:26.740
but it wasn't.

02:36:26.740 --> 02:36:28.900
It was an airplane and it stopped

02:36:28.900 --> 02:36:31.200
and it came up to me and it flashed me

02:36:31.200 --> 02:36:31.940
and it went away.

02:36:32.040 --> 02:36:37.810
Well, that absolutely changes everybody's world paradigm.

02:36:38.030 --> 02:36:40.570
It just completely changes it

02:36:40.570 --> 02:36:42.190
and sets you on a different course.

02:36:43.290 --> 02:36:47.110
So awakening or disclosure is for those,

02:36:47.390 --> 02:36:49.470
there's a lot of people that's already,

02:36:50.580 --> 02:36:51.220
that knows.

02:36:51.920 --> 02:36:54.820
So I don't think the government's going to ever announce anything.

02:36:55.100 --> 02:36:57.300
They're just going to keep telling you we have this.

02:36:57.540 --> 02:37:00.120
It's all that and make people get curious

02:37:00.120 --> 02:37:01.860
