02:37:50.650 --> 02:37:51.890
Well, I said earlier,

02:37:52.030 --> 02:37:54.730
maybe we have our own power to heal ourselves.

02:37:54.950 --> 02:37:56.070
We just don't know it.

02:37:56.710 --> 02:37:59.070
Do you feel like you healed yourself in that instance?

02:37:59.470 --> 02:38:01.650
No, I think they healed me

02:38:01.650 --> 02:38:05.690
and I think that they will heal or they can.

02:38:06.770 --> 02:38:07.870
They can heal you.

02:38:08.370 --> 02:38:09.950
I've seen it too many times.

02:38:10.150 --> 02:38:13.470
I've seen it happen in Australia over the phone,

02:38:13.550 --> 02:38:15.430
