02:38:22.550 --> 02:38:25.130
I just present her picture to the heaven.

02:38:25.130 --> 02:38:28.090
You know, it's all thought and intention.

02:38:28.690 --> 02:38:29.930
Our thoughts are very powerful.

02:38:30.070 --> 02:38:32.760
And our intentions are.

02:38:32.760 --> 02:38:33.620
I know they are.

02:38:33.780 --> 02:38:35.240
Yeah, they really are.

02:38:35.440 --> 02:38:40.050
