Right.

02:40:19.100 --> 02:40:20.580
And it's just so fast.

02:40:20.640 --> 02:40:25.080
It's like this fifth dimensional space that, you know,

02:40:25.180 --> 02:40:27.320
where you can, where you can travel kind of maybe

02:40:27.320 --> 02:40:28.440
between timelines.

02:40:28.440 --> 02:40:30.540
And then when you die, you're able to, you know,

02:40:30.600 --> 02:40:30.760
traverse the space.

02:40:30.760 --> 02:40:31.300
You can traverse that.

02:40:31.400 --> 02:40:33.600
And it's sort of hard to talk about a lot of these things,

02:40:33.740 --> 02:40:33.920
but.

02:40:34.480 --> 02:40:35.320
That's a big one.

02:40:35.620 --> 02:40:37.580
You know, I believe when we die,

