So if you have physical artifacts around an event happening, you can argue, say this is

03:02:06.530 --> 03:02:10.250
evidence that this happened this way, or this happened another way.

03:02:10.250 --> 03:02:15.110
If you have conflicting physical artifacts where you don't have physical artifacts, it's,

03:02:15.110 --> 03:02:19.770
